    "title": "Track Days Between Follow-Up Visits per Patient",
    "prompt": "A telehealth platform stores completed visits in a `patient_visits` table. Each patient may have multiple visits over time. Write a query that returns one row per visit showing the patient_id, visit_date, visit_type, and `days_since_last_visit` (the number of days between this visit and the patient's previous visit). If a visit is the patient's first visit, `days_since_last_visit` should be NULL. The platform wants to identify patients who schedule follow-ups more than 60 days after their prior visit. Order the results by patient_id ascending, then visit_date ascending.",
